    "Preserve the exact number of '#' characters, ';' delimiters, '||' newline tokens, and C format specifiers (%d, %s, etc.).",
    "NEVER use characters missing from the game .rff fonts: avoid em-dash (—), en-dash (–), superscript a (ª), degree symbol (°), curly apostrophe (’), asterisks (*), and caret (^) inside prose.",
    "Use ASCII apostrophe ('), straight double quotes (\") or font curly quotes ONLY if matching EN, and ASCII hyphen (-). Masculine ordinal º (U+00BA) is supported.",
